[node name="InstructionsLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Panel/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Proximity Chat Troubleshooting[/b]

If voice chat isn't working, please check:

[b]1. Windows Microphone Permissions[/b]
   • Open Windows Settings (Win + I)
   • Go to Privacy & Security > Microphone
   • Make sure \"Microphone access\" is ON
   • Allow Steam to access your microphone

[b]2. Steam Voice Settings[/b]
   • Click the button below to open Steam Voice Settings
   • Select your microphone from the dropdown
   • Click \"Test Microphone\" and speak
   • You should see the input level bar move
   • Adjust the volume slider if needed

[b]3. In-Game Indicators[/b]
   • When you speak, you'll see \"🎤 Speaking...\" in the top-left
   • When others speak, you'll see 🎤 above their head

[b]Note:[/b] Proximity chat is always-on (no push-to-talk required)"
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false

[node name="HSeparator2" type="HSeparator" parent="Panel/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2

[node name="OpenSteamSettingsButton" type="Button" parent="Panel/VBoxContainer"]
